**[Critical]** `processMetaLane`'s catch block does not record `dispatchedBodies` or `dispatchedComments`, so a `handleInbound` failure leaves the dedup collections un-advanced and the same PR/issue body and comments will be re-dispatched on the next poll, posting duplicate error comments. Every other lane records dedup keys in its catch block: `processPerCommentLane` (line 342), `processAggregateLane` (lines 494–495), `tryFirstContactBody` (line 546). `processMetaLane` is the sole exception.

```suggestion
    } catch (err) {
      process.stderr.write(
        `[Channel:${this.name}] handleInbound failed for ${kind} ${issueNumber}: ${err}\n`,
      );
      await this.postErrorComment(chatId, issueNumber);
      this.recordDispatched('dispatchedBodies', `${chatId}|${threadId}`);
      for (const comment of comments) {
        this.recordDispatched(
          'dispatchedComments',
          this.commentDedupKey(comment),
        );
      }
    }
```

<details><summary>中文说明</summary>

`processMetaLane` 的 catch 块不记录 `dispatchedBodies` 和 `dispatchedComments`。`handleInbound` 失败后，去重集合未推进，下次轮询会重复下发并在 GitHub issue/PR 上留下重复的错误评论。其他三条 lane 在 catch 中都记录了去重键，唯独 meta lane 没有。

</details>

_— qwen3.7-max via Qwen Code /review_

