discussion_comments.comment_body:
**[Critical]** All three lane methods (`processPerCommentLane`, `processAggregateLane`, `processMetaLane`) call `handleInbound` without a per-item try/catch. The old code wrapped each `handleInbound` in its own catch. The new code lets the first failure abort the entire lane.

— Failure scenario: `processPerCommentLane` processes 5 comments. Comment 4's `handleInbound` throws (bridge error). The exception propagates, comment 5 is never processed. `firstError` is set, `markNotificationsAsRead` and cursor advance are skipped. Next poll re-fetches; dedup skips comments 1–3 but re-attempts 4. If 4 consistently fails, comment 5 is indefinitely delayed and the cursor is permanently frozen.

```suggestion
      try {
        await this.handleInbound(envelope);
      } catch (err) {
        process.stderr.write(
          `[Channel:${this.name}] handleInbound failed for comment ${comment.id}: ${err}\n`,
        );
      }
      this.recordDispatched('dispatchedComments', [dedupKey]);
      if (isMentioned && this.gate.isAllowed(envelope.senderId))
```

<details><summary>中文说明</summary>

三条 lane 方法都在没有 per-item try/catch 的情况下调用 `handleInbound`。旧代码在每次 `handleInbound` 调用外都有自己的 catch。新代码让第一次失败中止整条 lane。

故障场景：`processPerCommentLane` 处理 5 条评论，第 4 条的 `handleInbound` 抛出异常。异常传播，第 5 条永远不会被处理。`firstError` 被设置，`markNotificationsAsRead` 和游标推进被跳过。下次轮询重新拉取，去重跳过 1-3 条但重试第 4 条。如果第 4 条持续失败，第 5 条将无限期延迟，游标永久冻结。

</details>

_— qwen3.7-max via Qwen Code /review_

