discussion_comments.comment_body:
**[Critical]** `processDirectLane` ignores the boolean return value of `dispatchEnvelope` — Failure scenario: `review_requested` notification arrives → `findDirectTrigger` finds the event → `dispatchEnvelope` is called → `handleInbound` throws → `dispatchEnvelope` catches, posts error comment, returns `false` → `processDirectLane` returns normally regardless. The cursor's `lastProcessedAt` already advanced at line 204 BEFORE the processing loop, so on the next poll `findDirectTrigger` filters the event out by time (`created_at <= windowSince`). The review request or assignment is permanently lost from the agent's view. The error comment tells the user to "re-mention the bot", but `review_requested` and `assign` are automated events the user cannot re-trigger.

Contrast with `processCommentLane` (line 293: `if (!(await this.dispatchEnvelope(...))) continue;`) and `processAggregateLane` (line 382: `if (await this.dispatchEnvelope(...))`) — both check the return. `processDirectLane` is the only lane that ignores it. No test covers direct-lane dispatch failure.

```suggestion
    if (!(await this.dispatchEnvelope(envelope, ctx.issueNumber))) {
      process.stderr.write(
        `[Channel:${this.name}] direct dispatch failed for ${reason} ${ctx.issueNumber}\n`,
      );
    }
  }
```

<details><summary>中文说明</summary>

`processDirectLane` 忽略了 `dispatchEnvelope` 的布尔返回值。当 `handleInbound` 抛出异常时，`dispatchEnvelope` 捕获并发布错误评论后返回 `false`，但 `processDirectLane` 无论成功失败都正常返回。由于游标的 `lastProcessedAt` 在处理循环之前就已推进，下次轮询时 `findDirectTrigger` 会按时间过滤掉该事件。review request 或 assign 触发将永久丢失。其他 lane（`processCommentLane` 和 `processAggregateLane`）都检查了返回值，唯独 direct lane 没有。且无测试覆盖 direct lane 的 dispatch 失败路径。

</details>

