discussion_comments.comment_body:
**[Critical]** `decodeProcessOutput` has no try/catch around `new TextDecoder(encoding)`. `windowsCodePageToEncoding()` maps OEM code pages 437, 850, and 852 to labels `cp437`, `cp850`, `cp852` — all of which Node.js `TextDecoder` rejects with `RangeError`. In `cleanup()`, this throw propagates out of the `'exit'` event handler, `resolve()` is never called, and the shell execution promise hangs indefinitely. — Failure scenario: Windows machine with OEM code page 437 (US default) or 850 (Western Europe) → non-UTF-8 shell output → `getCachedEncodingForBuffer` returns `cp437` → `TextDecoder` throws → shell execution hangs forever

```suggestion
export function decodeProcessOutput(buffer: Buffer): string {
  if (buffer.length === 0) return '';
  const encoding = getCachedEncodingForBuffer(buffer);
  try {
    return new TextDecoder(encoding).decode(buffer);
  } catch {
    return new TextDecoder('utf-8').decode(buffer);
  }
}
```

<details><summary>中文说明</summary>

`decodeProcessOutput` 在 `new TextDecoder(encoding)` 周围缺少 try/catch。`windowsCodePageToEncoding()` 将 OEM 代码页 437、850 和 852 映射为 `cp437`、`cp850`、`cp852` 标签——Node.js 的 `TextDecoder` 均不支持，会抛出 `RangeError`。在 `cleanup()` 中，该异常会传播出 `'exit'` 事件处理器，`resolve()` 永远不会被调用，导致 shell 执行的 Promise 永久挂起。

</details>

